1
00:00:00,105 --> 00:00:01,645
Mereka melihat awan gelap

2
00:00:01,665 --> 00:00:03,633
mendekat, lalu bersorak:

3
00:00:03,653 --> 00:00:05,020
hujan akan turun.

4
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,135
Ternyata itu angin yang

5
00:00:06,155 --> 00:00:07,667
menghancurkan segalanya,

6
00:00:07,687 --> 00:00:08,844
kecuali bekas rumah mereka

7
00:00:08,864 --> 00:00:09,515
sendiri.

8
00:00:09,535 --> 00:00:10,277
Kaum 'Ad tinggal di

9
00:00:10,297 --> 00:00:11,760
bukit-bukit pasir,

10
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,487
Al-Ahqaf.

11
00:00:12,507 --> 00:00:14,575
Surah Al-Fajr menyebut Iram,

12
00:00:14,595 --> 00:00:15,829
dengan bangunan tinggi yang

13
00:00:15,849 --> 00:00:16,943
belum pernah dibangun di

14
00:00:16,963 --> 00:00:17,707
negeri lain.

15
00:00:17,727 --> 00:00:18,907
Nabi Hud bertanya kepada

16
00:00:18,927 --> 00:00:20,037
mereka:

17
00:00:20,057 --> 00:00:21,338
apakah kalian membangun istana

18
00:00:21,358 --> 00:00:22,406
di setiap tanah tinggi hanya

19
00:00:22,426 --> 00:00:23,164
untuk bermegah,

20
00:00:23,184 --> 00:00:24,449
dan benteng-benteng seolah

21
00:00:24,469 --> 00:00:25,522
akan hidup kekal?

22
00:00:25,542 --> 00:00:27,113
Ia mengingatkan nikmat mereka:

23
00:00:27,133 --> 00:00:28,848
ternak, anak-anak,

24
00:00:28,868 --> 00:00:30,273
kebun, dan mata air.

25
00:00:30,293 --> 00:00:31,343
Jawab mereka:

26
00:00:31,363 --> 00:00:32,209
sama saja,

27
00:00:32,229 --> 00:00:33,804
kau menasihati atau tidak.

28
00:00:33,824 --> 00:00:35,212
Ini hanya adat orang-orang

29
00:00:35,232 --> 00:00:36,775
dahulu, dan kami tidak akan

30
00:00:36,795 --> 00:00:37,307
diazab.

31
00:00:37,327 --> 00:00:38,920
Bahkan mereka menantang:

32
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,097
datangkan azab yang kau

33
00:00:40,117 --> 00:00:41,692
ancamkan, kalau kau benar.

34
00:00:41,712 --> 00:00:42,735
Hud menjawab:

35
00:00:42,755 --> 00:00:43,788
ilmu tentang itu hanya pada

36
00:00:43,808 --> 00:00:44,360
Allah.

37
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,578
Aku hanya menyampaikan.

38
00:00:45,598 --> 00:00:47,281
Lalu datang awan yang menuju

39
00:00:47,301 --> 00:00:48,241
lembah-lembah mereka.

40
00:00:48,261 --> 00:00:49,990
Mereka mengira itu hujan.

41
00:00:50,010 --> 00:00:51,631
Ternyata angin yang sangat

42
00:00:51,651 --> 00:00:52,916
dingin, berhembus tujuh malam

43
00:00:52,936 --> 00:00:53,396
delapan hari,

44
00:00:53,416 --> 00:00:54,373
terus-menerus.

45
00:00:54,393 --> 00:00:55,627
Surah Al-Ahqaf menyebut,

46
00:00:55,647 --> 00:00:56,896
angin itu menghancurkan segala

47
00:00:56,916 --> 00:00:58,785
sesuatu, sampai yang tersisa

48
00:00:58,805 --> 00:00:59,868
hanya bekas tempat tinggal

49
00:00:59,888 --> 00:01:00,654
mereka.

50
00:01:00,674 --> 00:01:02,469
Pendengaran, penglihatan,

51
00:01:02,489 --> 00:01:03,738
dan hati mereka tidak berguna

52
00:01:03,758 --> 00:01:04,908
sedikit pun.

53
00:01:04,928 --> 00:01:06,410
Bangunan tertinggi tak bisa

54
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:07,923
menahan angin yang diperintah.

55
00:01:07,943 --> 00:01:09,235
Menurut kamu,

56
00:01:09,255 --> 00:01:10,504
apa yang sedang kita bangun

57
00:01:10,524 --> 00:01:11,495
agar terasa kekal?

58
00:01:11,515 --> 00:01:12,455
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

59
00:01:12,475 --> 00:01:13,618
bersama AUDIRA.

